hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1290.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from a reliable source from Amr ibn Shuayb from his father from his father's father that the Messenger of Allah"
"1290.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from a reliable source from Amr ibn Shuayb from his father from his father's father that the Messenger of Allah"
"1291.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1291.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1292.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm that Aban ibn Uthman and Hisham ibn Ismail used to mention in their khutbas built-in liability agreements in the sale of slaves"
"1292.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm that Aban ibn Uthman and Hisham ibn Ismail used to mention in their khutbas built-in liability agreements in the sale of slaves"
"1293.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Salim ibn Abdullah that Abdullah ibn Umar sold one of his slaves for eight hundred dirhams with the stipulation that he was not responsible for defects. The person who bought the slave complained to Abdullah ibn Umar that the slave had a disease which he had not told him about. They argued and went to Uthman ibn Affan for a decision . The man said"
"1293.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Salim ibn Abdullah that Abdullah ibn Umar sold one of his slaves for eight hundred dirhams with the stipulation that he was not responsible for defects. The person who bought the slave complained to Abdullah ibn Umar that the slave had a disease which he had not told him about. They argued and went to Uthman ibn Affan for a decision . The man said"
"1294.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba ibn Masud told him that Abdullah ibn Masud bought a slave-girl from his wife"
"1294.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba ibn Masud told him that Abdullah ibn Masud bought a slave-girl from his wife"
"1295.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar would say"
"1295.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar would say"
"1296.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Abdullah ibn Amir gave Uthman ibn Affan a slave-girl who had a husband whom he had purchased at Basra. Uthman said"
"1296.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Abdullah ibn Amir gave Uthman ibn Affan a slave-girl who had a husband whom he had purchased at Basra. Uthman said"
"1297.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf that Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf bought a slave- girl and found that she had a husband"
"1297.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf that Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf bought a slave- girl and found that she had a husband"
"1298.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1298.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1299.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1299.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1300.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Humayd at-Tawil from Anas ibn Malik that the Messenger of Allah"
"1300.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Humayd at-Tawil from Anas ibn Malik that the Messenger of Allah"
"1301.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'r-Rijal Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Haritha from his mother"
"1301.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'r-Rijal Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Haritha from his mother"
"1302.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from Kharija ibn Zayd ibn Thabit that Zayd ibn Thabit did not sell fruit until the Pleiades were visible"
"1302.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from Kharija ibn Zayd ibn Thabit that Zayd ibn Thabit did not sell fruit until the Pleiades were visible"
"1303.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar from Zayd ibn Thabit that the Messenger of Allah"
"1303.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar from Zayd ibn Thabit that the Messenger of Allah"
"1304.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn from Abu Sufyan"
"1304.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn from Abu Sufyan"
"1305.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abu'r-Rijal Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman heard his mother"
"1305.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abu'r-Rijal Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman heard his mother"
"1306.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz decided in a case to make a reduction for crop damage. Malik said"
"1306.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz decided in a case to make a reduction for crop damage. Malik said"
"1307.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abd ar-Rahman that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad would sell produce from his orchard and keep some of it aside"
"1307.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abd ar-Rahman that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad would sell produce from his orchard and keep some of it aside"
"1308.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr that his grandfather"
"1308.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr that his grandfather"
"1309.1","Yahya narrated to me, from Malik, from Yahya ibn Sa'id, that he heard Al-Qasim ibn Muhammad say: Yazid ibn Abd al-Malik separated men from their wives, and these women were mothers of children of men who had died, and they married them after one or two menstrual cycles. He separated them until they completed their waiting period of four months and ten days. Al-Qasim ibn Muhammad said: Glorified is Allah! Allah says in His Book: \"And those of you who die and leave wives...\" (2:234) - they are not wives."
"1309.2","Yahya narrated to me, from Malik, from Ibn Shihab: Abdullah ibn Amir gifted a slave girl to Uthman ibn Affan, who had a husband. He had bought her in Basra. Uthman said: \"I will not approach her until her husband divorces her.\" Ibn Amir appeased her husband, and he divorced her."
"1310.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Ata ibn Yasar said"
"1310.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Ata ibn Yasar said"
"1311.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd al-Hamid ibn Suhayl ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf from Said ibn al-Musayyab from Abu Said al- Khudri and from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1311.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd al-Hamid ibn Suhayl ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf from Said ibn al-Musayyab from Abu Said al- Khudri and from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1312.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Yazid that Zayd ibn Ayyash told him that he had once asked Sad ibn Abi Waqqas about selling white wheat for a type of good barley. Sad asked him which was the better and when he told him the white wheat"
"1312.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Yazid that Zayd ibn Ayyash told him that he had once asked Sad ibn Abi Waqqas about selling white wheat for a type of good barley. Sad asked him which was the better and when he told him the white wheat"
"1313.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1313.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1314.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn from Abu Sufyan"
"1314.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn from Abu Sufyan"
"1315.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al- Musayyab that the Messenger of Allah"
"1315.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al- Musayyab that the Messenger of Allah"
"1316.1",""
"1316.2",""
"1317.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Musa ibn Abi Tamim from Abu'l Hubab Said ibn Yasar from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1317.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Musa ibn Abi Tamim from Abu'l Hubab Said ibn Yasar from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1318.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abu Said al-Khudri that the Messenger of Allah"
"1318.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abu Said al-Khudri that the Messenger of Allah"
"1319.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Humayd ibn Qays al-Makki that Mujahid said"
"1319.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Humayd ibn Qays al-Makki that Mujahid said"
"1320.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard from his grandfather"
"1320.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard from his grandfather"
"1321.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that Muawiya ibn Abi Sufyan sold a gold or silver drinking- vessel for more than its weight. Abu'dDarda said"
"1321.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that Muawiya ibn Abi Sufyan sold a gold or silver drinking- vessel for more than its weight. Abu'dDarda said"
"1322.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1322.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1323.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1323.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1324.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that al-Oasim ibn Muhammad said"
"1324.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that al-Oasim ibn Muhammad said"
"1325.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abu'z-Zinad heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say"
"1325.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abu'z-Zinad heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say"
"1326.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say"
"1326.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say"
"1327.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Malik ibn Aus ibn al-Hadathan an-Nasri that one time he asked to exchange 100 dinars. He said"
"1327.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Malik ibn Aus ibn al-Hadathan an-Nasri that one time he asked to exchange 100 dinars. He said"
"1328.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Qusayt saw Said ibn al-Musayyab sell gold counterpoising for gold. He poured his gold into one pan of the scales"
"1328.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Qusayt saw Said ibn al-Musayyab sell gold counterpoising for gold. He poured his gold into one pan of the scales"
"1329.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1329.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1330.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1330.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1331.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1331.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1332.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Hakim ibn Hizam traded in food for people as Umar ibn al-Khattab had ordered him to do. Hakim re-sold the food before he had taken delivery of it. That reached Umar ibn al-Khattab and he revoked the sale and said"
"1332.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Hakim ibn Hizam traded in food for people as Umar ibn al-Khattab had ordered him to do. Hakim re-sold the food before he had taken delivery of it. That reached Umar ibn al-Khattab and he revoked the sale and said"
"1333.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that receipts were given to people in the time of Marwan ibn al-Hakam for the produce of the market at al-Jar. People bought and sold the receipts among themselves before they took delivery of the goods. Zayd Thabit and one of the Companions of the Messenger of Allah"
"1333.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that receipts were given to people in the time of Marwan ibn al-Hakam for the produce of the market at al-Jar. People bought and sold the receipts among themselves before they took delivery of the goods. Zayd Thabit and one of the Companions of the Messenger of Allah"
"1334.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that a man wanted to buy food from a man in advance. The man who wanted to sell the food to him went with him to the market"
"1334.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that a man wanted to buy food from a man in advance. The man who wanted to sell the food to him went with him to the market"
"1335.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said heard Jamil ibn Abd ar-Rahman the Muadhdhin say to Said ibn al-Musayyab"
"1335.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said heard Jamil ibn Abd ar-Rahman the Muadhdhin say to Said ibn al-Musayyab"
"1336.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abu'z-Zinad heard Sa'id ibn al-Musayyab andSulayman ibn Yasar forbid a man to sell wheat for gold on delayed terms and then to buy dried dates with the gold before he had taken delivery of the gold"
"1336.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abu'z-Zinad heard Sa'id ibn al-Musayyab andSulayman ibn Yasar forbid a man to sell wheat for gold on delayed terms and then to buy dried dates with the gold before he had taken delivery of the gold"
"1337.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that Kathir ibn Farqad asked Abu Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm about a man who sold food to be delivered at a future date to a man for gold and then with the gold"
"1337.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that Kathir ibn Farqad asked Abu Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm about a man who sold food to be delivered at a future date to a man for gold and then with the gold"
"1338","[1338] And he told me on the authority of Malik, on the authority of Abu al-Zinad, that he heard Sa`id ibn al-Musayyab say: There is no usury except in gold or silver. Or what is measured or weighed, with what is eaten or drunk.\\nMutta Imam Malik Hadith: 1338 Arabic Hadith:"
"1339.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said that there was no harm in a man making an advance to another man for food"
"1339.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said that there was no harm in a man making an advance to another man for food"
"1340.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Sulayman ibn Yasar said"
"1340.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Sulayman ibn Yasar said"
"1341.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Sulayman ibn Yasar told him that one time the fodder of the animals of Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Aswad ibn Abd Yaghuth was finished so he said to his slave"
"1341.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Sulayman ibn Yasar told him that one time the fodder of the animals of Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Aswad ibn Abd Yaghuth was finished so he said to his slave"
"1342.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard the same as that from al-Qasim ibn Muhammad from Ibn Muayqib ad-Dawsi. Malik said"
"1342.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard the same as that from al-Qasim ibn Muhammad from Ibn Muayqib ad-Dawsi. Malik said"
"1343.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Maryam asked Said ibn al-Musayyab's advice. \"\"I am a man who buys food with receipts from al-Jar. Perhaps I will buy something for a dinar and half a dirham"
"1343.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Maryam asked Said ibn al-Musayyab's advice. \"\"I am a man who buys food with receipts from al-Jar. Perhaps I will buy something for a dinar and half a dirham"
"1344.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Muhammad Sirin used to say"
"1344.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Muhammad Sirin used to say"
"1345.1",""
"1345.2",""
"1346.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yunus ibn Yusuf from Said ibn al-Musayyab that Umar ibn al-Khattab passed by Hatab ibn Abi Baltaa who was underselling some of his raisins in the market. Umar ibn al- Khattab said to him"
"1346.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yunus ibn Yusuf from Said ibn al-Musayyab that Umar ibn al-Khattab passed by Hatab ibn Abi Baltaa who was underselling some of his raisins in the market. Umar ibn al- Khattab said to him"
"1347","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Uthman ibn Affan forbade hoarding"
"1348","Yahya related to me from Malik from Salih ibn Kaysan from Hasan ibn Muhammad ibn Ali ibn Abi Talib that Ali ibn Abi Talib sold one of his camels called Usayfir for 20 camels to be delivered later"
"1349","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar bought a female riding-camel for four camels and he guaranteed to give them in full to the buyer at ar-Rabadha"
"1350","Yahya related to me that Malik asked Ibn Shihab about selling animals"
"1351","Yahya related to me from Malih from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1352","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Said ibn al- Musayyab said"
"1353","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Said ibn al-Musayyab that the Messenger of Allah"
"1354","Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn that he heard Said ibn alMusayyab say"
"1355","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad that Said ibn al- Musayyab said"
"1356",""
"1357","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"1358","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad said"
"1359",""
"1360","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that a man said to another"
"1361","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad was asked about a man who bought goods for 10 dinars cash or fifteen dinars on credit. He disapproved of that and forbade it. Malik said that if a man bought goods from a man for either 10 dinars or 15 dinars on credit"
"1362","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu Hazim ibn Dinar from Said ibn al-Musayyab that the Messenger of Allah"
"1363","Yahya related to me from Malik from Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban and from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1364","Yahya narrated to me, from Malik, from Nafi', from Abdullah ibn Umar: The Messenger of Allah ﷺ forbade the sale of the fetus of a fetus (habal al-habalah). This was a transaction that the people of the Jahiliyyah used to engage in. A man would buy a she-camel until the she-camel gave birth, and then the offspring within her belly gave birth."
"1365","Malik related to me that he had heard that Abdullah ibn Masud used to relate that the Messenger of Allah"
"1366","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from Busr ibn Said from Ubayd"
"1367","Yahya related to me from Malik from Uthman ibn Hafs ibn Khalda from Ibn Shihab from Salim ibn Abdullah that Abdullah ibn Umar was asked about a man who took a loan from another man for a set term. The creditor reduced the debt"
"1368","And it was narrated to me, from Malik, from Abu al-Zinad, from Sa'id ibn al-Musayyab: He used to say: It is forbidden to sell an animal for meat. Abu al-Zinad said: I asked Sa'id ibn al-Musayyab: What do you say about a man who buys an old ewe for ten sheep? Sa'id said: If he bought it to slaughter it, then there is no good in that. Abu al-Zinad said: And everyone I met among the people forbade selling an animal for meat. Abu al-Zinad said: And this used to be written in the covenants of the governors during the time of Aban ibn Uthman and Hisham ibn Ismail, forbidding that."
"1369","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1370","Malik related to me from Musa ibn Maysara that he heard a man ask Said ibn al-Musayyab"
"1371","Malik said there was no harm if a man who sold some drapery and excluded some garments by their markings"
"1372","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Abu Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm from Umar ibn Abdal-Aziz from Abu Bakr ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Harith ibn Hisham from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1373","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that Abu Rafi"
"1374","Malik related to me from Humayd ibn Qays al-Makki that Mujahid said"
"1375","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umar ibn al-Khattab said that he disapproved of one man lending another food on the provision that he gave it back to him in another city. He said"
"1376","And Malik related to me that he had heard that a man came to Abdullah ibn Umar and said"
"1377","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that he heard Abdullah ibn Umar say"
"1378","Malik related to me that he had heard that Abdullah ibn Masud used to say"
"1379","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1380","Malik related to me from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1381",""
"1382","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that a man mentioned to the Messenger of Allah"
"1383","Malik related to me that Yahya ibn Said heard Said ibn al- Musayyab say"
"1384","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said that he heard Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir say"
"1385","Malik related to me that he asked Ibn Shihab about a man who hired an animal"
